  "question": {
    "text": "If the tangent to the curve $y^{2}=x^{3}$ at $\\left(m^{2}, m^{3}\\right)$ is also a normal to the curve at $\\left(M^{2}, M^{3}\\right)$, then the value of $m M$ is",
